  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2017-12-28T11:55:51.612Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Having the ability to place a portal to, for example, a members world for a open world where only the people who have the password can enter. I hope this gets accepted because it could also be used for mazes/puzzle rooms which would need a password to continue etc.\n\nHopefully this is an accepted idea. Thanks, average username.",
